nix — Nix package manager (multi-user, flakes enabled)

    nix shell nixpkgs#ripgrep        ripgrep in a temporary shell
    nix run nixpkgs#hello            run a package without installing it
    nix profile install nixpkgs#jq   install into your profile
    nix profile list                 what's installed

  Builds and downloads go through a root nix-daemon; you never need root.
  The store (/nix) is on the `csb-nix` volume, shared by every sandbox that
  enables this addon, so installs persist across csb runs. Your profile
  (~/.nix-profile) lives in your home volume and points into that store.

  Builds run without Nix's build sandbox (sandbox = false): an unprivileged
  container can't provide the namespaces it needs.

  Daemon log: /var/log/nix-daemon.log
